#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Multi-Agent Startup Operations System
=====================================
Single-file system for Recruitbots AI — Agentic AI Engineer Challenge 3.

Four collaborating agents coordinate through a LangGraph state machine:

  Planner     → breaks a business objective into delegated tasks
  Researcher  → gathers market / product evidence via tools
  Analyst     → scores options and drafts recommendations
  Execution   → turns recommendations into an actionable plan

Shared memory lives on the graph state and is persisted with LangGraph's
MemorySaver checkpointer. Agents communicate by writing to a message bus
on the same state. A human approval checkpoint interrupts before the plan
is marked final.

No machine-origin labels appear in customer-facing plan text.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

